# Versions

`[project].version` in `pyproject.toml` owns the application version. `make version`
reads it; wheel/sdist metadata must agree. The template version in
`.template-version.json` is independent and records Copier's full source commit
and selected ref. Copier owns `.copier-answers.yml`; never rewrite it manually.

Apply the [shared compatibility policy](https://github.com/serrja/baseRules/blob/main/docs/versioning.md)
to this project's actual imports, CLI, HTTP, configuration and runtime minimums.
Database revisions, protocol versions and chart versions have separate meanings.
A template update preserves application version and owner code/settings/tests;
review conflicts and migrations before committing the update.
